    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwesiga nikwo kumanya hatalimu kulengeshanyia aha byo tushuubira mara bitalikuboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'eira Ruhanga akabasiima aha rw'okugira okwesiga kw'engeli egi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwikiliza nikwo kutuha okushobokerwa okwo ekigambo kya Ruhanga nikyo kyatonzire ensi egi, kityo ebilikuboneka bikaruga omu bintu ebitalikuboneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwesigakwe Abeli akatambira Ruhanga ekitambo ekirungi yashaga Kaini. Okwesigakwe nikwo kwamuhindwire okuboneka ali mugorogoki, na Ruhanga yakunda ebihongobye kumujulira obugorogoki obwo. Abeli akafa, kyonkai aha rw'okwesigakwe na mwaha akyagambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okwesiga, Enoki akatwara Ruhanga omw'iguru ataija akafa. Tiyabonekire, kuba Ruhanga akamutwara. Kyonkai Ruhanga atakamutwete akabanza yamusiima, kuba akamushemeleza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuzira kwikiliza tikilikushoboka kushemeleza Ruhanga. Omuntu kwija kugoba ahali Ruhanga naragirwa kubanza kwikiliza okwo Ruhanga ogwo asingireho mara arongora abamuhiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga kayatatiire Noa, akamugambira ebilikwija kubaho, Noa aha rw'okwesigakwe akamuhulira yakora obwato kuhungya omutungogwe. Aha rw'okwesigakwe akoleka ensi okwo etagira kwesiga. Aho Ruhanga yahindura Noa mugorogoki, obugorogoki obwo obuzarukana omu kwesiga. Aho Ruhanga omugorogoki yahindura Noa mugorogoki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu akagira okwesiga, Ruhanga kayamwesire yamuhulira, yafurukira omu nsi eyo alitungwa obusika, mara yafuruka atalikumanya mbali alikugya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwesigakwe okwo kwamwikaza omu nsi y'endagano ali mufuruki, omw'ihanga, yatura omu mahema na Isaka na Yakobo abasikabe b'endagano egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba alindiliire ekigo ekyombekire aha misingi, eyayombekirwe Ruhanga wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sara nawe akagira okwesiga yatungwa obushobora bw'okutwara enda, n'orwo amakiro g'okutwaliraho enda gabaire gamulengire. Kyonkai akaba namanya okwo Ruhanga ayabaire amushubiize atyo yabaire ali mwesigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo omuntu omoi, ayabaire nashusha afire, n'iwe yatabukirweho oruganda, abaijukuru bangi nk'enyanyinyi z'aha iguru, obutabarwa nk'omushenye gw'omwaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bona bakagwa omu kwesiga, bafa batakatungirwe byo babaire baraganisiibwe, nibabibonera harai kushai, nibabyebuga, nibamanya kurungi okwo bonene omu nsi egi bali bahinguzi kushai mara bazahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abalikugamba migambire egi nibaba nibolekya okwo balikuhiga ensi ey'okuba yabo bakagituliramu kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabakutekeleize ensi eyo bafurukiiremu, bakuboine obushango bw'okugigarukamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe okwo kili nibegomba ensi elikushagaho oburungi, nilyo iguru. Aha rw'ekyo ti kihemu ahali Ruhanga kwetwa ishebo, aha rw'okuba yabatekatekeire ekigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu omu kwesigakwe Ruhanga akamulenga, yatamba Isaka ekitambo. Aburahamu ayabaire araganisiibwe akaikiliza kutamba omwanawe ekitambo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owo Ruhanga yabaire agambireho ati, “Baijukuru bawe balyetelerwa ahali Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu ogu akabona okwo Ruhanga aina obushobora bw'okuhimbura abafire: Yamara yamuha obulebero bw'okuhimbuka, yamugarulira omwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka akagira okwesiga yaha Yakobo na Esau emigisha nashura ebili omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwesigakwe Yakobo kayabaire nafa, yaha buli mutabani wa Yozefu omugisha. Yayehigika aha mutwe gw'enkoniye, yafukamira Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwesigakwe Yozefu kayabaire yaija kufa, akagamba okwo Abaisiraeli balifuruka Misiri, yabaragiilira n'okwo baramuziika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'enshonga y'okwesiga Musa kayazairwe abazairebe bamusheleka emyezi eshatu, aha rw'okuba bakabona okwo omwana yabaire ali murungi, n'omuku gwa Farao tibagutiinire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwesigakwe Musa kayakuzire yayanga kwetwa mutabani wa muhara wa Farao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabona hakili abone enaku n'eihanga lya Ruhanga kushaaga okushemelerwa amashemelerwa g'amafu agalikuhingura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabona okushasha aha rwa Kirisito lili itunga lihango kushaaga eitunga lyona lya Misiri, kuba omu maisho yashubiragayo erongoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwesiga kukamwihya Misiri atatinire kiniga kya Farao; kuba akatekanira byona okw'obon'oti Ruhanga atalikuboneka namubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwesigakwe kukamuha okwekomya Pasika n'okushaimura obwamba, Omusiliikya ayaisire emizigaijo ataija akasilikya mizigaijo ya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
